<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>__DISPLAY_NAME__ Meta Skills · 使用场景 Catalog</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f7f8fa;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --ink-1: #111827;
  --ink-2: #374151;
  --ink-3: #6b7280;
  --line: #e5e7eb;
  --brand: #1f4f7a;
  --brand-soft: #e8f2fa;
  --bridge: #4f46e5;
  --bridge-soft: #eef2ff;
  --warn: #b45309;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(17,24,39,.04), 0 4px 14px rgba(17,24,39,.06);
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro SC", "PingFang SC", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink-1);
  line-height: 1.65;
  font-size: 15px;
}
.hero { background: #172033; color: #fff; padding: 48px 32px 40px; }
.hero-inner, main { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .72; }
h1 { margin: 12px 0 8px; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.18; }
.subtitle { max-width: 880px; margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.84); font-size: 16px; }
.meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
main { padding: 34px 32px 72px; }
section { margin-bottom: 44px; }
h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 25px; }
.section-lead { margin: 0 0 20px; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 14px; }
.grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr)); }
.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-top: 5px solid var(--brand);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 20px 22px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
.card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 18px; }
.card p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--ink-2); }
.tag { display: inline-block; border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px 8px; margin: 0 5px 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand); }
.rows { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
.row strong { color: var(--ink-3); }
.note { border-left: 4px solid var(--warn); background: #fffbeb; color: #78350f; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13.5px; }
code { font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">openLifeOS · Pluggable Meta Skill Router</div>
    <h1>Meta Skill 使用场景 Catalog</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">这个根层 catalog 回答“什么场景下使用哪个 meta skill，以及是否需要组合调用”。不要写固定 skill 数量；skill 集合可插拔，新增或删除时只维护对应路由卡片。</p>
    <div class="meta">
      <span><strong>Owner:</strong> __OWNER_NAME__</span>
      <span><strong>Repo:</strong> __REPO_NAME__</span>
      <span><strong>Catalog Type:</strong> pluggable meta skill router</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section>
    <h2>维护规则</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">每个 meta skill 都应有一个卡片。卡片描述使用场景、输入、输出、边界和 drill-down catalog，而不是描述当前有几个 skill。</p>
    <div class="note">新增 meta skill 时：创建 <code>capabilities/&lt;capability-id&gt;/SKILL.md</code>，同时创建 <code>capabilities/&lt;capability-id&gt;/SKILLS-CATALOG.html</code>，并在本文件增加一张路由卡片。</div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Meta Skill 路由卡片</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>__META_SKILL_NAME__</h3>
        <p>__META_SKILL_ONE_LINE_PURPOSE__</p>
        <span class="tag">__PRIMARY_SCENARIO__</span>
        <span class="tag">__DECISION_LAYER__</span>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row"><strong>何时使用</strong><span>__WHEN_TO_USE__</span></div>
          <div class="row"><strong>典型输入</strong><span>__TYPICAL_INPUTS__</span></div>
          <div class="row"><strong>典型输出</strong><span>__TYPICAL_OUTPUTS__</span></div>
          <div class="row"><strong>边界</strong><span>__BOUNDARIES__</span></div>
          <div class="row"><strong>深入地图</strong><span><code>capabilities/__CAPABILITY_ID__/SKILLS-CATALOG.html</code></span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>组合调用规则</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">如果一个任务同时包含构建、表达、身份、分身保真、复盘沉淀等维度，按任务对象和输出形态组合调用，不用固定数量假设。</p>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
